<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/icon_magda.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="About Magdalena Szymaniec — Senior Product Designer & Art Director based in Berlin." />
    <title>About — Magdalena Szymaniec</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:wght@600&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;600&family=Gentium+Plus:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      @keyframes page-fade-in {
        from { opacity: 0; }
        to   { opacity: 1; }
      }

      body {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        background-color: #f7f6fa;
        color: #302b36;
        min-height: 100vh;
        animation: page-fade-in 0.35s ease both;
      }

      a:not(.btn-cv):not(.btn-linkedin):not(.nav-link):not(.nav-identity) {
        color: #302b36;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
        text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
        text-decoration-color: #c8c5d0;
        transition: color 0.15s ease, text-decoration-color 0.15s ease;
      }

      a:not(.btn-cv):not(.btn-linkedin):not(.nav-link):not(.nav-identity):hover {
        color: #9b90cc;
        text-decoration-color: #9b90cc;
      }

      /* ── Nav ── */
      nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        background-color: #f7f6fa;
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 50;
      }

      .nav-identity {
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #302b36;
      }

      .nav-name {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 4px;
      }

      .nav-link {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #827d87;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 5px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        transition: color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
      }

      .nav-link:hover {
        color: #302b36;
      }

      .nav-link.active {
        background-color: #9b90cc;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .nav-link.active:hover {
        background-color: #8778bc;
      }

      /* ── Intro ── */
      .about-intro {
        padding: 40px 24px 32px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 28px;
      }

      .about-text {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-family: 'Lora', serif;
        font-size: 1.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.25;
      }

      .body-text {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .cta-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
        padding-top: 8px;
      }

      .btn-cv, .btn-linkedin {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #9b90cc;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
      }

      .btn-cv:hover, .btn-linkedin:hover {
        background-color: #8778bc;
      }

      .about-photo-wrap {
        display: none;
      }

      .about-photo {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        display: block;

      }

      /* ── Photo strip ── */
      .photo-strip {
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .strip-track {
        display: flex;
        width: max-content;
        will-change: transform;
        animation: scroll-photos 55s linear infinite;
      }

      .strip-track:hover {
        animation-play-state: paused;
      }

      @keyframes scroll-photos {
        from { transform: translateX(0); }
        to { transform: translateX(-50%); }
      }

      .strip-item {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        position: relative;
        margin-right: 4px;
      }

      .strip-item img {
        height: 200px;
        width: auto;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        object-fit: cover;
        display: block;

      }

      /* ── Cursor pill ── */
      #cursor-pill {
        position: fixed;
        pointer-events: none;
        background-color: #302b36;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        white-space: nowrap;
        opacity: 0;
        transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
        z-index: 100;
        transform: translate(14px, -50%);
      }

      #cursor-pill.visible { opacity: 1; }

      /* ── Lightbox ── */
      #lightbox {
        display: none;
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88);
        z-index: 200;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 32px 24px;
      }

      #lightbox.open { display: flex; }

      #lightbox img {
        max-width: 100%;
        max-height: 72vh;
        object-fit: contain;
        border-radius: 16px;
      }

      #lightbox-caption {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-align: center;
      }

      @media (hover: none) {
        #cursor-pill { display: none; }
        .strip-item { cursor: pointer; }
      }

      /* ── Motto ── */
      .motto-section {
        padding: 48px 24px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .motto-label {
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        color: #827d87;
      }

      h2.motto-heading {
        font-family: 'Lora', serif;
        font-size: 1.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.25;
      }

      .logos-carousel {
        overflow: hidden;
        position: relative;
        padding-top: 8px;
      }

      .logos-track {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 56px;
        width: max-content;
        animation: scroll-logos 32s linear infinite;
      }

      .logos-track:hover {
        animation-play-state: paused;
      }

      @keyframes scroll-logos {
        from { transform: translateX(0); }
        to { transform: translateX(-50%); }
      }

      .logos-track img {
        height: 24px;
        width: auto;
        display: block;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      /* ── Testimonials ── */
      .testimonials-section {
        padding: 48px 24px;
        background-color: #f3f1fe;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      h2.section-heading {
        font-family: 'Lora', serif;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.25;
      }

      .t-card {
        background-color: #f7f6fa;
        border: 1px solid #d8d2f0;
        padding: 24px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .t-person {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .t-person img {
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        object-fit: cover;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .t-name {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #302b36;
      }

      .t-role {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        color: #827d87;
      }

      .t-quote {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .t-quote p {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      /* ── Footer ── */
      footer {
        background-color: #eae5fc;
        padding: 24px 24px 40px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .links {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        list-style: none;
      }

      .links a {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      .copyright {
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        color: #827d87;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      /* ── Desktop ── */
      @media (min-width: 640px) {
        nav {
          padding: 16px clamp(48px, 8vw, 160px);
        }

        .nav-identity {
          display: flex;
        }

        .nav-identity img {
          width: 34px;
          height: 34px;
        }

        .about-intro {
          padding: 80px clamp(48px, 8vw, 160px);
        }

        .about-text {
          gap: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
          line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .body-text {
          font-size: 1rem;
          max-width: 58ch;
        }

        .strip-item img {
          height: 300px;
        }

        .motto-section {
          padding: 72px clamp(48px, 8vw, 160px);
          gap: 20px;
        }

        h2.motto-heading {
          font-size: 2.75rem;
          max-width: 26ch;
          line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .logos-carousel {
          mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 10%, black 90%, transparent);
          -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 10%, black 90%, transparent);
        }

        .logos-track img {
          height: 28px;
        }

        .testimonials-section {
          padding: 72px clamp(48px, 8vw, 160px);
          gap: 32px;
        }

        .t-card {
          padding: 40px;
          gap: 24px;
          max-width: 720px;
        }

        h2.section-heading {
          font-size: 2rem;
        }

        footer {
          padding: 40px clamp(48px, 8vw, 160px) 56px;
        }

        .links {
          flex-direction: row;
          gap: 32px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav>
      <a href="/" class="nav-identity">
        <img src="/icon_magda.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="" />
        <span class="nav-name">Magdalena Szymaniec</span>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/" class="nav-link">home</a>
        <a href="/about" class="nav-link active">about</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="about-intro">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h1>Who is Magdalena?</h1>
        <p class="body-text">A geek since 1991, I grew up in Poland obsessed with books, art, video games, folklore and anything with a good symbol hidden in it. That curiosity eventually landed me a scholarship to the United World College Red Cross Nordic in Norway with people from every corner of the world, debate club, volunteering, art journals, the whole thing. I studied philosophy, wrote my Extended Essay on the infantilisation of Japanese society (kawaii culture deserves serious academic interest, obv), and learned something that stuck: people's experiences shape how they think and what they choose. An obvious finding that keeps coming back in my work as a designer.</p>
        <p class="body-text">From there, a Davis UWC Scholars scholarship took me to Ringling College of Art and Design to study illustration. The jump to UX was natural — illustrators solve problems, just like designers do. Same process, slightly different medium. I take real pride in having started with that craft, and I still paint.</p>
        <p class="body-text">Berlin has been home for over ten years now, recently made official with a German passport. Outside of work I have an unreasonable number of hobbies: running (Munich HM, Berlin S25), yoga, pilates, miniature painting, games. And I like horses though whoever called them majestic has clearly never met one.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a href="/CV_magdalena.pdf" class="btn-cv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download My CV</a>
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/magdalena-szymaniec-6a697246" class="btn-linkedin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check Out That LinkedIn</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="photo-strip">
      <div class="strip-track">
        <div class="strip-item" data-label="Visitng BoJack in Holywoo" data-original><img src="/about/main.png" alt="Visitng BoJack in Holywoo" /></div>
        <div class="strip-item" data-label="In the wild" data-original><img src="/about/painting.png" alt="In the wild" /></div>
        <div class="strip-item" data-label="That time I became Deutsch" data-original><img src="/about/german.png" alt="That time I became Deutsch" /></div>
        <div class="strip-item" data-label="Iskra, my assistant" data-original><img src="/about/assistant.png" alt="Iskra, my assistant" /></div>
        <div class="strip-item" data-label="How to train your dragon" data-original><img src="/about/horse.png" alt="How to train your dragon" /></div>
        <div class="strip-item" data-label="Running 25km and hurting my foot" data-original><img src="/about/running.png" alt="Running 25km and hurting my foot" /></div>
