    <section class="motto-section">
      <p class="motto-label">My motto</p>
      <h2 class="motto-heading">The less ego at play, the better the design.</h2>
      <p class="body-text">I believe the best design happens when ego gets out of the way. You're not designing for yourself — you're a vessel for understanding problems, using empathy, and creating meaning out of chaos. I've never chosen a project for portfolio appeal. Some of my most fascinating work has been on complex B2B problems that don't photograph well — and I wouldn't have it any other way.</p>
      <p class="body-text">Below some of the companies I had a pleasure of collaborating with.</p>
