    <section class="testimonials-section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Word on the streets</h2>
      <div class="t-card">
        <div class="t-person">
          <img src="/about/laurenz.png" alt="Laurenz Reichl" />
          <div>
            <p class="t-name">Laurenz Reichl</p>
            <p class="t-role">CEO, Co-Founder at Blindmate</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="t-quote">
          <p>Magda has been an incredible addition to the team from the first day of joining blindmate as a freelancer over a year ago. Needless to say she's an incredibly skilled UX/UI designer who gets stuff done and is 100% reliable.</p>
          <p>But here's what makes Magda a real pleasure to work with:</p>
          <p>#1 She's got true dedication to quality. Once she's made sure every detail works, Magda is not shy to improve on the original briefing.</p>
          <p>#2 Our devs love her, even though she's a designer 😊. She approaches UI design with the mindset of an engineer, making implementation of her designs a breeze.</p>
          <p>#3 And on top, Magda is simply a great human to work with. She's fun, authentic, straightforward, and smart. Really not much more you could ask for! It's been an absolute blast working with you, looking forward to many more features together!</p>
        </div>
